  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Databaser CRPC</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Databases CRPC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r kunskaps&#xF6;verf&#xF6;ring av hantering av databaser i samband med att CRPC upph&#xF6;r med sin verksamhet och denna &#xF6;verf&#xF6;rs till Ministry of Human Rights and Refugees. St&#xF6;det skall m&#xF6;jligg&#xF6;ra en effektiv hantering av databaserna s&#xE5; att MHRR i framtiden kan utf&#xF6;ra de uppgifter betr&#xE4;ffande &#xE5;terl&#xE4;mnande av egendom f&#xF6;r f&#xF6;rdrivna personer som hittills har legat p&#xE5; CRPC.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support for transfer of knowledge regarding handling of databases in connection with that CRPC is discontinuing its activities and transfer these to the Ministry of Human Rights and Refugees. The support should enable an efficient use of the databases so that the MHRR in the future will be able to perform the tasks of the CRPC regarding property claim by displaced persons and refugees.</narrative>
  </description>
